{"id":"ccab98562a5cca1d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-closed-unbounded.md","title":"Closed Unbounded Set","display":"df-closed-unbounded — Closed Unbounded Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closed-unbounded","aliases":["58-df-closed-unbounded"],"display":"df-closed-unbounded — Closed Unbounded Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[58-df-supremum]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closed-unbounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closed-unbounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-unbounded — Closed Unbounded Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da76334bd8496c66\" href=\"?note=da76334bd8496c66\" title=\"58-df-supremum\">58-df-supremum</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C \\subseteq \\kappa\">\\(C \\subseteq \\kappa\\)</span> (子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (limit ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}_S\\)</span> (closed unbounded predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup(A)=\\bigcup A\">\\(\\sup(A)=\\bigcup A\\)</span> for sets of ordinals (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da76334bd8496c66\" href=\"?note=da76334bd8496c66\" title=\"58-df-supremum\">58-df-supremum</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-unbounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{Club}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left((\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\sup(C\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\in C\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-unbounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{Club}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\left((\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\sup(C\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\in C\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CU}(C, \\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{CU}(C, \\kappa)\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is closed (contains limits of its subsets) and unbounded in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For regular uncountable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, intersections of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> club sets are club; a sequence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> clubs has a club diagonal intersection, not necessarily a club ordinary intersection.</li>\n<li>For regular uncountable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is stationary iff it meets every club subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-supremum","status":"resolved","id":"da76334bd8496c66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-supremum]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (limit ordinal, see [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (limit-ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-supremum","status":"resolved","id":"da76334bd8496c66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sup(A)=\\bigcup A$ for sets of ordinals (see [[58-df-supremum]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C \\subseteq \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup(A)=\\bigcup A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-unbounded} \\vdash \\mathrm{Club}_S(C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha<\\beta)\\land\\forall\\lambda<\\kappa\\;\\left((\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\sup(C\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to\\lambda\\in C\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CU}(C, \\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d457d5a39e54cfe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (closed-unbounded predicate, see [[58-df-closed-unbounded]])"},{"id":"dcaac1dfe9e1d292","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-closed-unbounded]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-closed-unbounded]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-closed-unbounded.md|58-df-closed-unbounded]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["81cabbac7fa4d75d","da76334bd8496c66"]}